ttom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-05-31/03-hauhaucs-qwen3-6-35b-a3b-uncensored-hauhaucs-aggressive.png\" alt=\"HauhauCS/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">HauhauCS/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive 是基于 Qwen 系列架构的微调变体模型。其核心特点是移除了内容审核和安全过滤机制，从而允许模型输出不受限制的文本内容。该模型主要面向特定研究用途或追求完全自由生成的开发者群体。由于缺乏内置的安全防护，使用者在使用时需自行承担相关内容生成的合规性风险与社会影响。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-05-31/04-meituan-longcat-longcat-video-avatar-1-5.png\" alt=\"meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.5\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.5</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.5 是美团开发的一款专注于视频化身生成的专业模型。该模型能够处理视频序列并生成逼真的虚拟形象，支持视频内容的创意编辑与数字化身创建。它主要应用于虚拟主播、短视频创作以及远程交互等领域，通过强大的视觉生成能力，为用户提供高效的视频内容生产工具，助力实现更具表现力的多媒体应用效果。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-05-31/05-liquidai-lfm2-5-8b-a1b.png\" alt=\"LiquidAI/LFM2.5-8B-A1B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">LiquidAI/LFM2.5-8B-A1B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">LFM2.5-8B-A1B 是 Liquid AI 推出的高性能语言模型，参数规模为 80 亿。该模型采用了先进的架构设计，旨在实现高推理效率与高质量的输出。作为一款通用型基座模型，它在逻辑推理、文本创作和代码编写等多种任务中均有不俗表现，适合集成到各类企业级应用或开发框架中，能够满足对处理速度和模型响应精度有较高要求的开发需求。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qHfXxy1pes1eXWicJWxHTLGxL323Gh029A2JkOLQP3EibEUYlkLeB2vgvuhnUoyqoPg1etjxySFodeOgR45dHqS2s2kZ8KyjA65MCPMPbBBGo/0?wx_fmt=gif\" alt=\"底部引导\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\" /></section></section>",
